###
# Create a Skins game
POST {{baseUrl}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "YOUR_TRIP_ID",
  "name": "Skins Game Round 4",
  "format": "SKINS",
  "playType": "STROKE_PLAY",
  "scoringType": "NET",
